<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Hebrew</book>
  <para style="h">Hebrew</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hebrew</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebrew</para>
  <para style="mt">Hebrew</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tanglai-in Pasien in kamsangte tungtawnin i pu i pate tungah lampi tuomtuom tawh tamveipi thu na gen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ahi vangin tami ni nukhiate ah leitung a bawlpa, sil bangkim a luo dinga a sepa ahi a Tapa tungtawnin eite tungah thu ang gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Pasien’ minthanna kilahna le Pasien’ hina bang lien puo a, a vanglien ama’ kammal tawh sil bangkim a tukip hi. Ama in mawnate adingin kisiensuona a bawl zaw ciengin sang pen muna om Vanglienpa’ zietlamah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in vantung mite sangin min thupizaw a luo ma bangin vantung mite sanga a tungtuongzaw tham ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in vantungmi kungah, “Nang ka Tapa na hi hi; tuni-in kang piengsah zo hi,” a ci ngai ta amah? Ahi sihle khatvei tawh, “Kei ama’ Pa ka hi ding a, ama ka tapa hi ding hi,” a ci ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua banah leitungah a tacil ang peipi ciengin ama in, “Pasien’ vantungmi zosie in ama bie uheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vantung mite tawh kisai-in ama in, “Ama in a vantung mite hui suohsah a, ama’ nasemte meikuong a suohsah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Tapa tawh kisai-in ama in, “Pasien aw, na kumpi topha kumtawnin om ding a, dihna ciengkhut pen na kumpi gam uhna ciengkhut hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang in dihna na it a, gitlona na muda hi; tua ahi ziehin Pasien, na Pasien in nang pen na guolte hlengin kipahna sathau tawh ang nu zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale, “ Topa aw, a cilin leitung na phut a, vantungte nangma’ khutsuo ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuate kisie nanle nang na om den ding a, puon bangin tuate zosie a tulmang ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />puontuol bangin tuate kizieltum ding a, puonsil bangin tuate kikhel ding hi. Hizongle nang na kibang den ding a, na kumte tawp ngai lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in vantung mite koi pen tungah, “Na galte na keng ngahna ka hisah masangsie ka zietlamah to in,” a ci ngai ta ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien’ nasepna ah vantung mite zosie pen hutdamna luo ding mite’ nasem dinga kisawl hlate hi lo uh amah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin eite i tolmang lo nadingin i zahsa thute nahpi tahin i thudon mama uh kul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile vantung mite tungtawnin thu kigen pen kip a, tua thute mang loin a palsat mi poma in a kituoh mawna dan thuoh uh ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua zataha a lien hutdamna thudon loin om leih bangci bangin suotah thei ding i hei? Tua thu pen Topa in amasa-in ei gen zo a, a thugen a za mite in eite tungah a thuman ahina ei lah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien in zong limte, a lamdangte, na lamdang tuomtuomte, le a deina banga a hawm Hlagau Siengtho letsongte tungtawnin tua thu teci a panbe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eite in i gengen ahi ang tung ding leitung pen Pasien in vantung mite’ khut sungah koi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hizongle mi kimkhat in a teci panna uh mun khatah, “Na ngaisut tham dingin mihing bang hi lel a, na thudon tham dingin mihing tapa bang hi lel ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vantung mite sangin amate a niemzaw hiau-in na bawl a, minthanna le patawina na khusah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a keng nei vuah sil bangkim koi-in na uh sah hi,” ci-in teci kipang zo hi. Tu-in sil bangkim amate uhna nei-ah koi a, Pasien in amate a uhsah lo bangma a om sih hi. Tua hi napi tu tadi-in sil bangkim a uh lam i mu nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin vantung mite sanga a niemzaw deu dingin bakhat sung a kibawl pah Jesu in Pasien hepina hang tawh mi zosie adingin sina a ciep thei nadingin ama in sina a thuoh ziehin tu-in minthanna le patawina lukhu kikhusah zo hi, ci i mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama ading le ama tungtawnin sil bangkim a piengsah Pasien in ta tampite, minthanna ah a peipi thei nadingin a thuohna tawh hutdamna a bawlcil pa Jesu a bukimsah ding pen a kilawm mawng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a siengthosah pa le a kisiengthosah mite in a unpi-un pa khat beh a nei uhi. Tam thu ziehin Jesu in sanggamte ci-a amate a hlat ding pen maizum lo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama in, “Ka sanggamte tungah na min ka phuong ding a, mihonpi laikimah nangma kang phat ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale, “Ama ka muong ding hi,” a cikia hi. Tuale, “Pasien ei piehsa tate tawh tanah ka om hi,” a cikia leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tate pen cilesa nei mite ahi ziehin, ama in zong sina tungtawnin sina vanglietna a nei dawimangpa a suhsiet thei nadingin ama ma zong tua bang ma-in cilesa nei-in ang pieng phot a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />si ding a giin ziehun sala a kiman mi zosie a hlakhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile ama pen vangtung mite hu dinga ang pei ahi sih a, Abraham’ suonlehlahte hizaw hi, ci ang kicien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pasien nasepna sungah mi lainat siem le a muonhuoi siempu lienpa a suo thei nading le, mipite mawna ziehin thoidamna a bawl thei nadingin sil bangkimah a sanggamte banga ang suo ding ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen gimna thuohna tawh ama ma na ki ze-et ngai zo ahi ziehin, ama in ze-etna a thuoh mite ei hu thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin vantung lam hlatna a nga a siengtho ka kithuopite aw, eite in i pulah uh sawltahpi le siempu lienpa Jesu thu lungngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses zong Pasien’ inn sung zosie-ah a muonhuoi ma bangin ama zong nasep a guonpa tungah a muonhuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin a inn sangin a innlam pa a kipatawi zawh ma bangin Jesu pen Moses sanga a thupi zaw patawina nga dingin a kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />(Bangzieh ahei cile inn zosie pen a lam mi khat om a, ahi vangin sil zosie a lampa Pasien ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nua cienga a kigen ding thute tungah teci pang dingin tu-in Moses pen nasem khat bangin Pasien’ inn sung buppi-ah muonhuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin tapa khat hina tawh Khris pen Pasien’ inn sungah muonhuoi hi. I muonna le i kisahtheipi uh lametna i tuhkip leh ama’ innkuonpi i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Lai Siengtho in a gen ma bangin, “Tu-in ama’ aw na zah uleh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />gamlahah ze-etna hun sunga a ledo bangun, na lungtang uh khausah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kum sawmli sung ka silbawlte a mu vangun, tua munah na pu na pate un ei na ze-et uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tua khang mite tungah ka lung a thah a, keima in, ‘A lungtang uh lampiel zing a, ka lampite a thei sih uhi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lung a thah a, ‘Ka tawlngahna-ah amate a lut sih ding uhi,’ ci-in ka kiciem hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, note a koima po in a hingzing Pasien kung panin ang pielmangsah uplana lungsim a nei migilo na nei khah lo nadingun kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin “tuni” a kici sungin mawna solna ziehin koima in na lungsim uh na khausah lo nadingun nisimin khatlekhat na kihanthawn un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite in i kimuonna masa pen a tawp donga i tuhkip nah leh Khris’ pawlte i suoh zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lai siengtho in, “Tuni-in ama’ aw na zah uleh, ledo lai hun bangin na lungtang uh khausah sih un,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Za zo napi a ledo lai koite ahi uh ahei? Moses makaina nei-ah Egypt gam a nuasie mi zosie hi lo uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongle kum sawmli sung ama koi tunga lungthah ahei? Mawna a bawl zieh vua gamlahah a pumpi a puamatte tungah hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tawlngahna munah amate a lut sih ding uhi, ci-in ama in a tomlaw, thu mang lote tung simlo koi tungah hi ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n up lona ziehin amate a lut thei sih uhi, ci thu i thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi tah ziehin ama’ tawlngahna sungah lut thei nading kamciem kihong lai ahi ziehin koima tua mun a tung zo lo na suo khah lo nadingun kidawm vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate kunga lungdamna thu a tun bang lienin, eite kungah zong ang tung zo ta hi; hinanle tua thu a za mite in upna tawh kop lo ahi ziehin a zahsa uh thu in amate a phatuomsah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen ei a um mite i hi leh tua tawlngahna munah i lut vua, leitung a kiphu cila kipanin a silbawlte a man siengsa hi napi Pasien in, ‘Ka tawlngahna-ah amate a lut sih ding uhi,’ a ci ma bangin, “Ka lungthah a, ka kiciem zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen ni sagina thu tawh kisai-in mun khatah tam bangin gen a, “A ni sagi ni-in a nasepna zosie panin Pasien tawlnga hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami mun ma-ah, “Ka tawlngahna ah amate a lut sih ding uhi,” cikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tua mun a lut ding mi pawlkhat om lai a, thuman lona hang tawh lungdamna thuhoi a za masate lut thei lo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama in, “Tuni-in ama’ aw na zah uleh na lungsim uh khausah sih un,” ci-in a kigen bangin tua zaw a sawtpi ciengin David tungtawnin ama in, “tuni” a kici nidang khat a sekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen Joshua in amate tawlngahna a na pie zo hi leh Pasien in nidang khat thu a na nuagen nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pasien mite adingin sabbath tawlngahna khat a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen a nasepna panin Pasien a tawlngah bangin Pasien’ tawlngahna sunga a lut mite zong a nasepna panun a tawlnga ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tua banga amau’ thumanlona ziehin koima pua loin tua tawlngahna mun i lut thei nadingin i hi theina za tawh hanciem ciet vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasien’ thu nungta-in na sem thei a, a langni tuoha a hiem namsau sangin hiemzaw a, hlagau le lungsim, guletang kituonate le cintuigu dong phalsuo-in sun pailet thei hi; tua in lungtang’ ngaisutnate le tupnate zong theicien thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mai-ah a kiselcip thei a kipiengsah na khat beh a om sih a, i thu tut nading pa mitmu ah na zosie a lie a dal om loin kilang sinsen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin eite in vantungte kalin a pei pa, a lien siempu lien pa Pasien’ tapa Jesu i nei lang kalsie i pulah uh tua upna kiptahin tu ciet vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile i thanemnate-ah ei lainat thei lo siempu lien pa a nei i hi sih vua, tuale mahin eite ma bangin ze-etna namcin na thuoh ngai napi mawna a nei lo siempu lien khat a nei i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin eite in i kisap huna ei panpi dingin khuotuona nga-in hepina i mu thei nadingin hangsan tahin hepina topha nai ciet vai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihingte lah panin a kiteel siempu lien poma pen amate tangin Pasien tawh a kisai silte tungah vaipuo ding le, letsongte le mawna zieha biehpiehnate pie ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amama in thanemna na thuoh ngai zo ahi ziehin thu thei lote le a lungkhau mite lungnem tahin kem thei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tam thu ziehin ama in ama’ mawnate ading beh hi loin, mipite’ mawna ziehin zong biehpiehna a pieh ding kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koima in tua patawina ama thu-in nga thei lo a, Pasien in Aaron a hlat bang tehteha a hlat mite beh in nga thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n siempu lien pa a suo thei nadingin Khris ama le ama a kipatawi sih a, ahi vangin ama kungah, “Nang ka Tapa na hi hi, tuni-in nang kang piengsah zo hi,” a ci pa in a sesa ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mundang khatah zong ama in, “Melchizedek’ gui zui-in tawntung siempu na hi ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cilesa tawh ama a op hun lai-in Jesu in sina panin a hunkhie thei pa tungah hlitui tawh thungetnate le thumnate nei-in nahpi-in kiko a, tuaci’n zatahna tawh ama’ ki-apnate Pasien in a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama Tapa khat ahi vangin a thuohna tungtawnin thumanna a sin hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />bukim tahin a kibawl zaw ciengin ama’ thu a mang mi zosie adingin kumtawn hutdamna’ nah suoh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Melchizedek’ gui zui-in Pasien in siempu lien dingin a se zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami thu tawh kisai gen ding tampi i nei a, ahi vangin thu tel zo paipai lo na hi ziehun teltahin gen ding a hamsa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note tam bang hunah sie na suo ding uh hun ta napi Pasien thutah bulpite ang hil ding mi khat na kisam uhi. Antah hi nai loin nawizu na kisam uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile nawizu a hinpi na lai poma nausen hi lai ahi ziehin dihna thu a theisiem thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongle antah i ci pen sielepha khen nadingin a ngaisutnate uh zangin a kisinsa mi picingte ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Khris thu a kipat cilna thuhilna lelte nuasie vai-in, picinna lam manaw vai. Pasien upna lam le a sisa nasepnate panin kisiakiana lamah bulkip phut nawn loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />baptize-na tawh kisai thuhilna, khut ngahna, misite thawkiana le kumtawn thukhennate bulpat kiakia nawn sih vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasien in pha a sah leh tami i bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khatvei khuovah in tanvahin vantung letsong a ciem ngaisa, Hlagau Siengtho sungah satanh nga zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ang tung ding khanghun vanglietnate le Pasien’ thu hoina a ciemsa mite
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a pua uleh, amate nopthu tawh Pasien’ tapa khailia kia-in simmaw thuoh dinga a pholah uh ahi ziehin amate adingin kisiakia-in a kipuophat ding uh pieng thei nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tunga a kie guotuite hupin angkung posah a, a hlote a phatuomsah leitang in Pasien tung panin thupha a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua leitang in ling le khau a posah leh kimanna nei lo ahi a, samsiet thuoh bai ding ahi hi; a tawpna ah kihaltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kang itte aw, tam banga thu i gen vangin, no tawh a kisai hutdamna tawh kizomin sil hoizawte nomau-a’ ahi hi, ci-in ka lung a muong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien a thutang lo ahi sih hi; ama in na nasepna uh, ama hang tawh misiengthote na vana ule na va lai dingte uh tungah itna na lahnate uh ang kitheimaw bawl sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lametna bukim ang tun nadingin note khat ciet in a tawp tanpha-in tua banga hanciemna na lah ciet ding uh kang deisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n note pen mi thasiete suoh loin, upna le lungduoina tungtawnin kamciem a luote in a ette mite na suo zawh ding uh kang deisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien in Abraham tungah kamciem a pieh lai-in, ama sanga a lienzaw kiciem nading koima om lo ahi ziehin ama le ama kiciem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Thupha kang pie tahtah ding a, kang pungsah ding hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua bangin Abraham in lungduoi tahin a thuoh zaw ciengin tua kamciem nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate sanga a lienzaw mi khat’ min tawh mihingte a kiciem vua, tua kiciemna in thu kigen pen kipsahin kithutuna zosie a vengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ma bangin Pasien in a kamciem a luote tungah a kikhel ngai lo ama’ tupna thute a kicien zaw lai dingin a lah nuom ciengin, ama in kiciemna khat tawh a kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n a kikhel thei lo thu nite tungtawnin Pasien in zuouthu a gen ding pen pieng thei lo a, tua pen ama a beel eite in i mai-a kikoi lametna i tuhkip nadingin nahpi tahin i kihanthot thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eite in hlagau ading a kicien le a kip tembaw khina siakawi ahi tami upna i nei vua, tua upna in puondal nualam mun siengtho sungah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua munah eite tangin lamsiel pa Jesu na lut zo a, Melchizedek’ gui zui-in tawntung siempu lien a suoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami Melchizedek kici pen Salem kumpipa, Sangpen Pasien’ siempu hi a, ama in kumpite a zawna panin ang kilekia Abraham na dawnin thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham in zong ama tungah a neisa zosie sung panin sawm-ah-khat a pie hi. A masa penin a min a khietna, “Dihna kumpipa,” hi a, tua banah, ‘Kilemna kumpipa,’ a cina ahi, “Salem kumpipa,” zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama pen pa nei lo, nu nei lo, khanggui nei lo hi a, hinkhuo kipatna le tawpna zong nei loin, hizongle Pasien’ Tapa tawh kisunin kumtawn siempu-in a om den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />En un, ama bangza-a lien ahiei! Pupi Abraham nangawn in a galvan matte panin sawm-ah-khat ama na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siempu za a nga Levi suonlehlahte pen Abraham suonlehlahte ma hi napi, a sanggam a mipite kung panin sawm-ah-khat a kai nadingun thupiehna na nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate khanggui sungah a kihal lo tam pa in Abraham tung panin sawm-ah-khat na sang a, kamciemnate a nga pa zong thupha na pie lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lienzaw pa in a neuzaw pa thupha a pieh pen niel thei ding hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu khatah a si thei mihingte in sawm-ah-khat sang uhi; a thudang khatah ama hing hi, ci-a teci panna a nga mi pa in tua sawm-ah-khat a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sawm-ah-khat a sang Levi mama nangawn in Abraham tungtawnin sawm-ah-khat pie hi, kici thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen Melchizedek in Abraham a vaidot lai-in Levi pen a pupi’ taai sungah omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi-te siempu hina tungtawnin kicinna kinga hileh- azieh pen mite in tami siempu hina nei-ah thukham a na nga uh ahi a- bang dingin Aaron gui zui ahi lo, Melchizedek gui zui siempu dang khat a pien ding kisam lai ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen siempu hina a kikhel ciengin, a thukham zong a kikhel ding kisam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in tam bang thute a kigenna pa pen maitam-a na a sem ngai lo minam dang sung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile i Topa uh pen Judah minam sung pana ang pieng ahina kitel mama a, Moses in tua minam tawh kisai-in siempute thu bangma a gen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Melchizedek tawh a kibang siempu dang khat ang pien ciengin tami thu ang kicien deudeu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tua siempu ang suoh pa pen pumpi tawh kisai a kisam ngainate tungtawna ang suoh hi loin, a kisie thei lo hinna’ vanglietna tungtawna ang pei ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile, “Nang in Melchizedek gui zui-in kumtawn siempu na hi hi,” ci-in ama thu teci a pang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu khatah thupieh lui thanemin a kizah thei tah lo ziehin kituomkhin zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Azieh pen thukham in bangma a bukimsah thei sih hi); thu dang khatah eite in Pasien kung i nai thei nadingin a hoizaw lametna khat ei kipie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam pen kiciemna khat tawh kikipsah hi; bangzieh ahei cile siempu a suoh dangte in kiciemna lo tawh siempu za nga ahi uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahi vangin ama kunga thugen mi khat in, “ Topa kiciem zo a, a lungsim a khel sih ding hi. ‘Nang, tawntung siempu na hi hi,’ ” na ci ahi ziehin siempu ang suoh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ma bangin Jesu zong a hoizaw thuciemna kipsah pa ang suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua teng banah sina in amate nasep zopsuoh ding khahtan ahi ziehin siempu masate pen tampi a pha uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ahi vangin ama hing zing ahi ziehin a siempu za zong a tukip den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi dung zui-in ama tungtawnin Pasien a nai mite a thumpieh dingin hing zing ahi ziehin ama in a tawntungin a hundam thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a siengtho, paubanna a nei lo, a buabang lo, mawneite lah panin a kikoicing, vantungte tunga a kitawisang tua bang siempu lien pa khat nei ding pen a kilawm mama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama pen siempu lien dangte tawh a kibang sih a, a masa-in ama mawna ading, tua zaw ciengin a mipite mawna adingin nisielin biehpiehna a pieh ding a kisam sih hi; ama in tami pen khatvei beh a bawlna tawh a kimang den dinga a sep ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thukham in siempu liente dingin a thanem mite se a, hizongle thukham nua-a ang pei kiciemna thu in ahile kumtawnin a bukim dinga kibawlsa Tapa a se hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in i gen nop bulpi pen tami ahi hi: Eite in vantunga Thupina kumpi topha zietlam-ah a to tua bang siempu lien khat i nei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama pen mihingte lamsa ahi lo, Topa in a lam puonbuh tahtah ahi siengtho muna a sem pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile siempu lien zosie, letsongte le biehpiehnate pie dinga kisesa ahi hi; tua ahi ciengin tami siempu pa in zong a pieh ding sil khat a nei ding kisam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thukham dung zui-in letsongte a pie ding siempute om ta ahi ziehin, tu-in ama leitunga om hi leh siempu ahi thei vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in mun siengtho khat sungah biehna a lui vua, tua khu vantunga om thu’ a lim maimai le a hlim ahi lel bo hi; azieh pen puonbuh lam dinga Moses a kipat ciengin, “Muol tunga ang kilahsa lim bang tehtehin na zosie na bawl ding kithei gige in,” ci-in thu kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanle tu-in Jesu in a thupizaw nasepna khat nga zo a, tua dinmun ah ama pen thuciemna tawh a kikipsahsa a thupizaw thuciemna’ palai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thuciemna masa a khiel lo hi leh thuciemna nina pen sui a ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien in amate mawsah nading mu-in ama in tam bangin a ci ciengin: “Israel innkuon le Judah innkuonte tawh thuciemna tha ka phu ding ni ang tung valon ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt gam panin amate peipi dinga a pu a pate uh ka khut tawh ka kai lai-a, amate tawh ka bawlsa thuciemna bang ahi sih ding hi; azieh pen amate in ka thuciemna a zop sih vua, tuaci’n ken zong amate ka thudon sih hi, Topa in a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami in Israel innkuon tawh, tua hun zaw cienga ka bawl ding ka thuciemna ahi hi. A lungsim sung vuah ka thukhamte ka guong ding a, a lungtang tung vuah tuate gielin, amau’ Pasien ka hi ding a, amate zong khu keima mi ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in, ‘ Topa thei in,’ ci-in khatlekhat kihil loin, khatlekhat a kici sih ding hi. Azieh pen amate zosie in a neu pen pan a gol pen dongin keima ei thei ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in a khielnate vuah ka khuotuo ding a, keima in a mawnate uh ka phawhkha ta sih ding hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ma in, “Thuciemna tha khat,” a gen ciengin a masa pen a tul a suohsah zo hi. Tua a tulsa le a lui pen a sawt lo-a maimang ding ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuciemna masa pen nangawn in biehna-a zah ding ngainate le leitung mun siengtho zong a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen puonbuh khat kilam a, a dan masa pen sungah meivah tunna, sabuoi, le Ompina khomun om a, tua pen Siengtho Mun kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puonkhai a nina nualam ah Siengtho Pen a kici puonbuh khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua sungah kham tawh a kibawl panamtui hal nading maitam le a kimvel zosie-ah kham tawh a kizut thuciemna singkuong kitung a, tua sungah mana koina kham beel, Aaron ciengkhut meng le thuciemna suongpehte a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua tungah minthanna Cherub-te in hepina topha a liesuh uhi. Tu-in tami thute a neng a nawi-in i gen sieng thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam bangin kithawi kholnate a kibawl zaw ciengin, amau’ nasep ngai teng sem dingin puonbuh a dan masa sungah siempute a lut ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanle a dan nina sungah siempu lien pa kum khatin khatvei beh lut a, thei lona ziehin amama ading le mite mawna adingin sisan tawi-in biehna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin puonbuh a dan masa pen a om laisie, mun siengtho lut nading lampi kihong nai lo hi, ci thu Hlagau Siengtho in ei lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami in tuhun ading etsahna lim hi a, letsongte le biehpiehnate a pieh hun sungun a bie mite’ kitheina lungsim a bukimsah thei sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuate pen neh le dawn le baptize-na tuomtuomte, le pumpi tawh kisai ngainate beh hi lel a, puophat hun a tun masangsie zui dingte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin ang tungsa sil hoite a sem ding siempu lien ahi Khris ang tun ciengin, (khut tawh a kibawl lo, tami a kisiemsa nate ahi lo,) a lienzaw le a bukim puonbuh tungtawnin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />keel le bawngno sisante ahi lo, ama’ sisan tawh a kimang den dingin siengtho munah khatvei beh lut a, tua bangin ama in eite kumtawn tatkhietna ei ngasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen a bua mite tunga a kithe ahi keel si, bawngtang site, le bawnglaa halna vutte in a tahsa uh siengthosah ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kumtawn Hlagau tungtawnin paubanna a nei lo, Pasien tunga ama le ama a kipie Khris’ sisan in a si nasepna panin a hingzing Pasien i bieh thei nadingin eite’ sielepha theina lungsim bangza tahin siengthosah zawkan lai ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam thu zieh ma-in ama in thuciemna masa nei-a a tawnkhielnate panun amate a tat nadingin sina thuoh zo a hi ziehin, a kihlante in a kikamciemsa tawntung gou a luo thei nadingun, ama pen thuciemna tha palai ang hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sinua gamhluona lai bawlna-ah, tua lai bawlpa a sina thu kipsah phot kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua gamhluona lai a bawlpa a hin laisie tuami lai in thu nei thei lo a, ama a si cieng behin tua gamhluona lai kizang thei pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin thuciemna masa nangawn zong sisan loin kizang thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen thukham dung zui-in Moses in mi zosie tungah thupiehna vannuoi a gen lai-in, tui tawh bawngno’ si, keelte’ si la-in samul puon dupsan, hyssop sungah die-in tuate tawh laiziel le mipi zosie the a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tam pen Pasien in note adinga a sesa thuciemna sisan ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ma bangin ama in puonbuh le biehpiehna sunga a om vanzahte zosie zong sisan the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tahtahin thukham khut nei-ah na zosie a unpi phielin sisan tawh kisiengsah a, si kibuo loin maw maisahna a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin vantung nate’ lim maimaite pen tam bang bawldan ngainate tawh siensuo ding kisam a, ahi vangin vantung nate ahile tamte sanga a hoizaw biehpiehnate tawh siensuo ding kisam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen Khris in a tahtah tawh a kisun maimai, khut tawh a kibawl siengtho pen munah lut zaw loin, Pasien mai-ah eite tanga kilah dingin tu-in vantungah a va lut ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siempu lien pa in ama’ sisan ahi lo ganhing sisan tawh siengtho pen munah kumsiela a lut bangin Khris in ama le ama kum siela a kipieh kiakia ding kisam lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />kisam hi leh leitung piencil a kipanin tamveipi si zo ding hi. Ahi vangin khang tawpna-ah mawnate a pai dawh dingin ama le ama biehpiehna-in ang kizang a, a tawntung adingin khatvei ang kilang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihingte adingin ahile khatvei si ding pen sesa ahi a, tua zaw ciengin thukhenna a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n mi tampite mawna a puo dingin Khris in khatvei kipie zo a, mawna tawh kisai hi nawn loin, ama lam-enin a ngah mite hunkhie dingin a niveina ang kilah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thukham pen ang tung ding sil hoite’ hlim beh hi a, a tahtahte’ melpuoh mantah hi loin, kum khat zaw kum khat a kipie kiakia a kibang veve biehpiehnate ziehin tuami in ama a nai mite picingsah zo ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Picingsah thei hi leh a bie mite khatvei beh tawh a kimang den dingin a kisienthosah zo lang kalsie, mawna ziehin kisuonna kici poma nei nawn lo ding ahi ziehun biehna pieh ding a khawl ta sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanle tami biehpiehnate a kipieh sielin a kum kumin mite’ mawna a kiphawsah kiakia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen bawngtang’ sisan le keel’ sisan in mawna a lakhie mang thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin leitungah Khris ang pei lai-in ama in, “Biehpiehnate le silpiehte na deigaw sih a, ahi vangin kei adingin pumpi khat nei bawlpieh zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />meihal biehnate le mawna silpiehte ah nang na lungkim zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, (laiziel sungah keima’ thu a kigiel bangin) ‘Pasien, en in, na deina bang bawl dingin keima kang pei hi, Pasien aw,’ ka ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tung lamah ama in, “Biehpiehnate, silpiehte a kipanin meihal biehnate le mawna zieha silpiehte na lunggul sih a, tuate-ah zong na lungkim tuon sih hi,” a ci ciengin, (tamte thukham dung zui-a kipie ahi a)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua ciengin ama in, “Na dei bang a sem dingin kang pei zo ta hi,” a cibe kia hi. Ama in a nina pen a kipsah thei nadingin a masa pen a phietmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien’ deina bangin a kimang den dingin Jesu Khris’ pumpi khatvei beh a kipiehna tungtawnin eite ei kisiensuo zo ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n siempu kici poma in a nasepna ah ni khat zaw ni khat adingin, mawnate a ladawh thei lo, a kibang biehpiehnate ma a pie ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Khris in mawna adingin a kimang den ding biehpiehna khat ngentang a pieh zaw ciengin Pasien’ zietlamah to a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />khum huna kipanin ama in a galte a keng ngahna a suosah dongin a ngah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in a kisiengtho sahsa mite khatvei lien biehna tawh kumtawn adingin a bukimsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hlagau siengtho in zong eite tungah tami thu teci pang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tua nite zaw ciengin amate tawh thuciem ka bawl ding a, a lungtang sung vuah ka thukhamte koi-in, a lungsim sung vuah ka giel ding hi,” a ci zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ama in zong, “Keima in a mawnate ule thukham palsat-a a gamtatnate uh ka phawh nawn sih ding hi,” ci-in genbe lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tamte a kimaisahna munah mawna hanga biehnate om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka lawmte aw, eite in Jesu’ sisan ziehin mun siengtho lut nading kimuonna i nei lang kalsie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tua puonkhai tungtawnin (ama’ tahsa tungtawnin a ci na ahi hi) eite adingin hinna lampi tha ei honpieh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />eite in zong Pasien innkuon tungah a vaihawm siempu lien khat i nei ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />sielepha i theina uh lungsim dih lo panin i lungtangte tui tawh thesiengsa le i pumpite tui siengtho tawh sawpsiengsa-in, a kicien upna bukim le lungsim mantah tawh ama kung zuon ciet vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ei kamciem pa pen muonhuoi ahi ziehin lungkaa loin i lametna uh i pulahna thu tudet vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eite khatlekhat itna le gamtat hoina lamah i kithanopsuo thei nadingin ngaisun ciet vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi pawlkhatte kingainase bang hi loin kikhop ding thu nelsie sih vai. Topa’ Ni ang naina thu na thei ma bangun note khatlekhat na kihanthawn un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thuman thutah thei-in i san zaw ciengin thei giagua pi ma-in mawna i bawl leh tua mawnate mai thei nading biehpiehna om nawn lo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ahi vangin a zauhuoi thukhenna le a langpangte a katum ding thangpaina meikuong beh omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mosies thukham a palsat mi poma teci ni ahi sihle thum a op nah leh hepina om loin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahile Pasien’ Tapa simmaw bawlin, amate a siengthosah kiciemna sisan buasahin, hepina Hlagau a lungthahsah mite in bangza taha a nasie zaw gimna dan a thuoh dingin kilawm na sa uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite in, “Phulahna keima-a’ ahi a, keima in ka thuhkia ding hi,” a ci pa le, “ Topa in a mite tungah thu a khen ding hi,” a ci pa i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A hingzing Pasien khut sunga i pua khah ding uh zauhuoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in khuovah na nga zaw ciengun gentheina thuohin hamsa taha buoina na thuoh lai hun luite phawh kia unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />khat veivei mipi mai-ah zakona le hamsatna thuohin, khat veivei lah tua banga a kibawlsie mite na thuohpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Azieh pen note in thongkie mite na khuotuo vua, a hoizaw le a kipzaw neisa khat nei na hi lam uh na kithei ziehun, na neisate uh ang kilahpieh zongun lungdam tahin na sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin thaman lienpi ang ngasah ding na lungmuonna uh nuasie sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Azieh pen note in Pasien’ deina semin ang kikamciemsa thu na nga thei nadingun thuohzawhna na kisam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Azieh pen,” Bakhat sunga ang pei ding pa ang tung ding a, ang kiheh nawn sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />hinanle ka midih in upna tawh nungta ding hi. A kinuale poma tungah ka lungkim lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahi vangin eite i hi ule nuatolin a kisie mite lahah i kihal sih vua, upna nei-in gupna a ngasa mite lahah i kihal zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in upna i ci in i lametnate-ah lungmuonna hi a, i mu nai lo thute theicien na ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tahtahin upna ziehin i pu i pate in patahna a na nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eite in i mu thei nate pen i mu thei lo nate pana kibawl hi lo a, Pasien’ kammal tawh leitungte a kisiem ahi hi, ci thu upna tawh i theithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Upna ziehin Abel in Pasien kungah Cain-a’ sangin a sanhuoi zaw biehpiehna a pie hi. Tam tungtawnin ama midih ahi hi, ci patatna nga a, Pasien mama in ama’ silpiehte a thukimpi hi; ama a si zo vangin ama’ upna tungtawnin thu ei gengen lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Enoch in sina a thuoh lo nadingin upna tawh ama kilato hi; tuale, “Pasien in ama lato zo ahi ziehin ama a kimu nawn sih hi. Ama a kilahto masangin, “Ama in Pasien lungkimsah zo hi, ci-in teci kipang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Upna lo tawh Pasien kilungkimsah zo lo hi, azieh pen Pasien a nai poma in ama om tahpi hi, ci thu le ama a suite thaman pie hi, ci thu pen a up ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Upna ziehin a kimu nai lo thupiengte tawh Noah in Pasien’ thuhilna na mang a, a innkuonpite a hotkhiet thei nadingin tembawpi khat na bawl hi; tuami tawh ama in leitung mawsah a, tuale upna dung zui-a kinga dihna’ gou luopa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Upna tawh a gouluo nga nadinga a kiciemna mun pei dingin Abraham a kihlat lai-in, a pei nading mun nangawn thei lo napi, thumangin upna tawh a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kikamciemna gamah upna tawh bakhat sung teng a, ama tawh kibanga kamciem a luopi ding Isaac le Jacob-te tawh pemta bangin gamdang puonbuh sungah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in a gelpa le a lampa Pasien ahi bulkip nei khuopi a lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama vuoi mama tale upna tawh nau nei theina thu nga hi, Sarah mama zong a ciing hi tama le upna tawh kamciem a pie pa muonhuoi sa ahi ziehin nau nei theina thu nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a si tawh a kibang mi khat panin vana aasi za-a a tam, simzawh lo-a a tam tuipi pieu-a senel bangin suonlehlahte a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam mite zosie in a kikamciemsa gam nga lo-in, upna sungah a na si vua, hizongle a gamlapi panin amate galmu-in a na hopi uhi. Leitungah gamdang mi le peemta ahi lam uh a kithei uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />azieh pen tua banga thu gen mite in a ten nading uh gam khat sui ahi lam uh a kilangsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nuasiesa uh gam a ngaisun kia uh hi leh a kilekia nading uh hun lemtang nei zo tham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle amate in a hoizaw gam ahi tua vantung gam a na lunggul uhi. Tua ahi ziehin Pasien in amau’ Pasien a kici ding a na maizumpi vawt sih hi; a tahtahin ama in amate adingin khuopi khat bawl kholpieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ze-etna a thuoh ciengin Abraham in upna tawh Isaac a pie hi. Kamciem a nga pa in a tapa neisun pie dingin kithawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ama tung ma-ah, “Isaac tungtawnin nang adingin na suonlehlahte’ min kivaw ding hi,” ci-in kigen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasien in misite lah pan nangawnin mi khatpo thokiasah thei hi, ci-in ama in ngaisun a, tekahna-in gen leih ama in Isaac a ngakia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Upna ziehin Isaac in mailam hun adingin Jacob le Esau tungah thupha pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Upna ziehin Jacob in a si kuonin Joseph’ tate tungah thupha pie a, a ciengkhut dawnah kunin a na bie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joseph in upna tawh a si kuonin Egypt gam panin Israel-te peikhiet ding thu na gen a, ama in ama’ kivui ding thu zong na vaihlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Upna ziehin a nu le a pate in Moses hla thum sung phuol uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate in tua nausen a mel hoi lam a mu vua, kumpipa’ thupiehna giing loin upna tawh hla thum sung a phuol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses a gol ciengin Pharoah tanu’ tapa a kici ding nuom loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />mawna sungah bakhat sung nopsah ding sangin Pasien’ mite tawh bawlsietna thuohton ding a teelzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in mailam huna ama’ thaman ding mituhin a nei ziehin ama in Egypt’ neilelam teng sangin Khris adingin simmaw zako a thuohna pen a thupi zaw-in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in upna hang tawh kumpipa’ lungthah ding giing loin, Egypt gam na nuasie hi; azieh pen mu thei lo pa a mu bang danin ama in a thuoh kenkon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ta masa a susie pa in Israel-te’ tapa ta pen a suhkhah lo nadingin ama in upna tawh Peisan Pawi bawlin sisan a the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mite in upna tawh leigaw tunga lampei bangin San Tuipi a kantan uhi, ahi vangin Egypt-te in tua bang a bawl sawm ciengun tui in amate a taimang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in ni sagi sung upna tawh a kimvel zaw uh ciengin Jericho kulpi cimmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Numei pahtat nu Rahab in upna tawh thukante hoi tahin zin a na do ziehin, thumang lo mite tawh ama kisieton lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahile bang i genbe lai ding vuoi? Azieh pen Gideon, Barak, Samson, Zephthah, David, Samuel-te a kipanin kamsangte tungtang thu gen nading hun kicing lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Upna tungtawnin amate in kumpi gamte na zo gawpin, thutang tawh gam a na uh vua, kamciemte nga-in humpinelkai’ kam na hucip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Meikuongpi mit sahin, namsau’ ma panin na suohta vua, thanemna panin thakhauna nga kia-in, galdona-ah vang a na nei vua, gamdang galkapte a na delmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nupite in thawkiana tawh a misite a ngakia uhi. Adangte in a hoizaw thawkiana a nga thei nadingun a kihla ding nuom loin bawlsietna a thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Adangte in ahile simmawna le satna a thuoh vua, siakhau tawh kikhi-in thongkiehna nangawn a thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Suong tawh amate kisepin, sing-at tawh kituntan a, namsau tawh kithat hi; amate in tuuvun po le keelvun po silin, bangma nei loin a na vahvai vua, bawlsietna le khelbawlna na thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amate adingin leitung a kilawm nawn sih a, senel gam muoltung lah, leihawm lah le suonghawm sung lah po-ah a vah kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tam mite zosie in a upna ziehun phatna a na nga vangun a kikamciemsa thute a nga tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pasien in eite adingin a hoizaw na khat ei pie zo ahi ciengin eite lo tawh amate a bukim thei tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin i kimkot-ah taza taha a tam teci meiilomte in ei tuomcip lang kalsie, vangih zosie le ei gahcip mawnate hemkhie-in i masang vua kikoi tai kidemna-ah thuohzawhna tawh tai ciet vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I upna a piengsah pa le a bukimsah pa, ama mai-a kikoi lungdamna ziehin zumna khawh a sa lo, singlamte tungah gimna thuohin Pasien’ topha zietlamah a to Jesu mittuhna’n nei vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note lungkie-in na thanem lo nadingun mawnei mite’ huotbawlna a thuoh pa ngaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mawna tawh na kidona vuah note in sisan luonna za cieng dongin na do nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note in tapate bangin hing hopi-in ang hanthotnate na mangngil ta vua, “Ka ta aw, Topa ang thuhilna zangkhai ngaisut sinlen, dan ang pieh ciengin zong lungkie sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Topa in a it mite thuhil a, ama in a san a tate zosie a sat hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thu ang kihil nadingin gimnate thuoh un. Pasien in tate banga ang bawl uh ahi hi; azieh pen nu le pate’ thu hil lo tapa khu bangci ta ahi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tate zosie in a na tuo uh thuhilna na thuoh khah sih vua ahile ta tahtah hi loin zawlta na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua tham loin, eite in thu ei hil ding leitung pate i nei vua, amate i zatah uhi. Eite in hlagaute’ Pa thu mangin i hingzaw sam sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen leitunga i pate in bano khat sung adingin hoi a sah pen bangun thu ei hil vua, hinanle Pasien in ama’ siengthona i nga thei nading ule eite hoi nadingin thu ei hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ei kithuhil laitahin nuom kisa loin na kisa mama a, hizongle tua tawh a kisinsa mite in a nua lam ciengin lungmuonna tawh kipawl dihna ga a ga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a zaw na khutte uh lamto unlen, a thanem na khupte uh khausah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khelbaite kilawi loin a dam sieng thei nadingin na keng vua dingin lamphei siel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi zosie tawh kilem ding le siengtho ding lam na del un, bangzieh ahei cile siengthona lo tawh koima in Topa a mu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasien’ hepina nga loin koima a op lo nading le, sing zungkha po in buoina piengsah a, tua hangin mi tampi a bua lo nadingin pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Numei-pasal pahtatna a bawlte, an kam khat tawh innluoza a khawng, le a Pasien mi lo Isau bang koima a op lo nadingin pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nua lam ciengin Esau in thupha ngakia nuomin hlitui naptui tawh a suisui vangin kisiakia nading hunpha mu nawn lo ahi ziehin ama kiniel ta hi, ci thu na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kitham thei, meikuong, khuomiel, lungzinna le huipi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />pengkul ging, le tua awging a zate in amate tungah tua bang thu a kigenkia lo nadinga a thum vawtna uh mun khat a tung na hi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />(Azieh pen amate in, “Ganhing khat nangawn in tua muolpi a suhkhah leh suong tawh kiseplia ding hi,” ci-a thu kipie pen a thuoh zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tahtahin, tua a mu pen khu a cizathuoi seng ziehin Moses in, “Zau-in ka ci tun hi,” na ci hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin note pen Zion muol, a hingzing Pasien’ khuopi ahi vantung Jerusalem, simzawh lo pawibawl vantung mite kisuhtuona,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />vantunga min kikhumsa tapa a ta pente kikhopna mun, mi zosie thu a khen Pasien kung, le a kipicingsah midihte’ hlagau opna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />thuciemna tha’ palai ahi Jesu kung le Abel’ sisan sanga thu hoizaw a gen sisan kithena mun na tung zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua thu ang gen pa na niel khah lo nadingun pilvang un; azieh pen leitungah amate in thu hilkhol pa a niel ciengin amate suohta zo lo uh ahile, eite in vantung pana thu ei hil pa niel leih bangza tahin suohta la kan zaw lai ding i hi uh ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hun lai-in ama’ awging in leitung kithingsah a, ahi vangin tu-in ama in, “Leitung beh kithingsah loin, vantung zong khatvei ka kithingsah ding hi,” ci-in ei kamciem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tami, “Khatvei tawh” a ci kamteng in a kipiengsah nate ahi a kilawh thei zosie a kipaimang nading le a kilawh thei lote a op suoh thei nading thu a kawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin eite in a kilawh zo lo kumpi gam nga zo i hi ziehin i kipah ding vua, tuaci’n eite in zatahna le zauna tawh Pasien tungah san thei biehna i lui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Azieh pen eite’ Pasien in a haltum thei meikuong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khatlekhat na ki-itna uh kipsuoh taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuol mite zin do ding thusim loin om sih un, azieh pen tua bang zindona-ah pawlkhatte in thei khah loin vantung mite zin do ahi gige uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate tawh thongkieton bangin kingaisun unlen, thong sunga om mite phawh un; note mama zong bawlsietna a thuoh na hi ziehun bawlsiet na a thuoh mite na phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi zosie in kiten kipina thupisah hinlen, nupa lupna zong buasah sih uheh; azieh pen numei-pasal mawna a bawlte le angkawmte tungah Pasien in thu a khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sum deigawna panin na hinkhuo uh kemcing unlen na nei bangbang utawh lungkim un; azieh pen ama in, “Ke’n nang kang nuasie ngai sih ding a, zong kang taisan ngai sih ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n eite in kimuonna tawh, “ Topa pen ei panpi pa ahi hi; ka zau sih ding hi. Mite in bang ei law zo ding ahei?” i ci ngam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note tungah Pasien’ thu ang gen na lamkaite phawh zing un; amau’ luhinzie pana ang pieng thute ngaisunin a upna uh ette un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu Khris pen zani, tuni le a tawntungin kibang den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuhilna lamdang tuomtuomte in na kipuimangsah sih un; bangzieh ahei cile a zui mite dinga phatuomna a om lo anneh tuidawn tawh kisai ngainate hang tawh hi loin, hepina hanga lungsim khau pen a hoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puonbuh sunga nasemte in a neh thei lo maitam khat eite in i nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen mawhna zieha biehpiehna dingin siempu lien pa in siengtho muna a peipi sisan kilahna tua ganhingte’ pumpi pen giephuol pulamah kihaltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Jesu in ama’ sisan tawh mite a sienthosah nadingin khuopi kot pulamah sina a thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin eite zong giephuol pulamah pei-in, ama thuoh maizumna thuoh vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen tami munah a kip khuopi i nei sih vua, eite in ang tung ding khuopi i suizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin ama tungtawnin eite in Pasien tungah phatna biehpiehna tatsat loin pie vai. Tua khu ama’ min i pulahna i kamte’ ga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sil hoi bawl ding le na neisate uh mi hop ding kitheimaw bawl sih un, bangzieh ahei cile tam bang biehpiehnate in Pasien a lungdamsah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lamkaite uh’ thu na mang unlen, amate tungah na ki-ap un, azieh pen amate ahile na hlagau ang vilpieh ahi vua, a nasepnate uh Pasien kunga a pulah ding uh ahi hi. Tami pen lunggimna tawh semsah sih unlen, lungdamna tawh semsah zaw un. Bangzieh ahei cile tua bang hi loin, da pipi-a a sep ciengun note adingin phattuomna a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ko adingin thu ei nget pieh un; bangzieh ahei cile kote in sil zosie-ah patawi huoi taha sep ding ka dei vua, tuaci’n ko le ko kitheina lungsim siengtho ka nei lam uzong ka theicien uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na kung vuah a sawt lo-a kang pei baikia thei nadingin tua banga thu nei ngetpieh dingun kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumtawn thuciemna sisan ziehin tuucing lien pa, sina panin i Topa Jesu a thokiasah pa, kilemna Pasien in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ama’ deina banga na sep thei nadingun sil hoi bangkim ah ang bucingsah pa, Jesu Khris tungtawnin eite lahah ama’ lungkimna banga na a sem ama tungah a tawntungin minthanna om den taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, na kung vuah tomkimin lai hing hlah zo ka hi ziein, kang hanthotnate nei thuoh kenkon dingun kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I sanggam pa Timothy kihla zo ta hi, ci thu na thei un; a hunlapin ama ang tun khah leh note tawh i kimu ciengin ama tawh zong kang haw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na makaite zosie ule misiengthote zosie ei na noset pieh in. Italy gam pana ang hawte in zong ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note zosie tawh hepina hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
